{"3976320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RageFall", "steam_appid": 3976320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RageFall</strong> is a post-apocalyptic third-person shooter and Vehicular Combat  MMORPG where players explore a world destroyed by a mysterious force called the Signal. They join factions, fight for survival, and uncover the story behind humanity’s collapse. With deep gameplay, and strong lore, RageFall gives players true ownership and a chance to shape the world around them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/90c1dd681259defa970fb577bc2064ab.poster.avif?t=1763912427\" width=772 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/90c1dd681259defa970fb577bc2064ab.webm?t=1763912427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/90c1dd681259defa970fb577bc2064ab.mp4?t=1763912427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Players can join unique factions, each with their own beliefs and fighting styles, and must battle enemies in both on-foot combat and vehicle warfare. With fast action, large battles, and a wide variety of weapons and machines to master, every fight becomes a struggle for survival. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/1ce40c9e45757b60df60344e57654db3.avif?t=1763912427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras_big/1ce40c9e45757b60df60344e57654db3.avif?t=1763912427 width=1560 height=1094 /></span><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Immersive Post-Apocalyptic World:</strong> Explore diverse regions from ruined metropolises to underground networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Faction-Based Gameplay:</strong> Choose from five unique factions, each with distinct abilities and storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dynamic Combat System:</strong> Engage in both PvE and PvP battles with a variety of weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Vehicle Combat and Customization:</strong> Craft and battle in unique faction-specific vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Deep Crafting and Economy:</strong> Gather resources, craft items, and participate in a player-driven economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Epic Storyline:</strong> Uncover the mysteries of The Signal through cinematic quests and world-changing events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/560016aca61a1eb0343e427b3eb7a2c4.avif?t=1763912427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras_big/560016aca61a1eb0343e427b3eb7a2c4.avif?t=1763912427 width=1560 height=1094 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/660482e056a22b10bb5166ce31ae9c3b.avif?t=1763912427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras_big/660482e056a22b10bb5166ce31ae9c3b.avif?t=1763912427 width=1560 height=1094 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/9aaf91d1afae80947fd9de5b0d1399a5.poster.avif?t=1763912427\" width=772 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/9aaf91d1a