 Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Immersive Post-Apocalyptic World:</strong> Explore diverse regions from ruined metropolises to underground networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Faction-Based Gameplay:</strong> Choose from five unique factions, each with distinct abilities and storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dynamic Combat System:</strong> Engage in both PvE and PvP battles with a variety of weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Vehicle Combat and Customization:</strong> Craft and battle in unique faction-specific vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Deep Crafting and Economy:</strong> Gather resources, craft items, and participate in a player-driven economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Epic Storyline:</strong> Uncover the mysteries of The Signal through cinematic quests and world-changing events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/560016aca61a1eb0343e427b3eb7a2c4.avif?t=1763912427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras_big/560016aca61a1eb0343e427b3eb7a2c4.avif?t=1763912427 width=1560 height=1094 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/660482e056a22b10bb5166ce31ae9c3b.avif?t=1763912427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras_big/660482e056a22b10bb5166ce31ae9c3b.avif?t=1763912427 width=1560 height=1094 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976320/extras/9aaf91d1afae80947fd9de5b0d1399a5.poster.avif?t=1763912427\" widt